{
 "fps": 30,
 "frames": 917,
 "duration": 30.567,
 "captions": [
  {
   "text": "If this fungus gets inside an ANT\u2026",
   "emph": [
    "ant"
   ],
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 1.93,
   "show": 0.0,
   "hide": 2.13
  },
  {
   "text": "it can turn it into a ZOMBIE.",
   "emph": [
    "zombie"
   ],
   "start": 2.17,
   "end": 3.79,
   "show": 2.13,
   "hide": 4.03
  },
  {
   "text": "You see, it spreads",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 4.07,
   "end": 5.14,
   "show": 4.03,
   "hide": 5.105
  },
  {
   "text": "through the ant\u2019s body\u2026",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 5.145,
   "end": 6.11,
   "show": 5.105,
   "hide": 6.31
  },
  {
   "text": "and starts controlling its MUSCLES.",
   "emph": [
    "muscles"
   ],
   "start": 6.35,
   "end": 7.95,
   "show": 6.31,
   "hide": 8.19
  },
  {
   "text": "Then it forces the ant",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 8.23,
   "end": 9.53,
   "show": 8.19,
   "hide": 9.495
  },
  {
   "text": "to CLIMB a plant\u2026",
   "emph": [
    "climb"
   ],
   "start": 9.535,
   "end": 10.49,
   "show": 9.495,
   "hide": 10.69
  },
  {
   "text": "and bite down so hard",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 10.73,
   "end": 12.02,
   "show": 10.69,
   "hide": 11.985
  },
  {
   "text": "it can\u2019t let GO.",
   "emph": [
    "go"
   ],
   "start": 12.025,
   "end": 13.08,
   "show": 11.985,
   "hide": 13.32
  },
  {
   "text": "The ant DIES\u2026",
   "emph": [
    "dies"
   ],
   "start": 13.36,
   "end": 14.52,
   "show": 13.32,
   "hide": 14.82
  },
  {
   "text": "but the fungus is just getting STARTED.",
   "emph": [
    "started"
   ],
   "start": 14.86,
   "end": 16.81,
   "show": 14.82,
   "hide": 17.05
  },
  {
   "text": "Because over the next few days,",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 17.09,
   "end": 18.49,
   "show": 17.05,
   "hide": 18.67
  },
  {
   "text": "a giant stalk grows",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 18.71,
   "end": 19.99,
   "show": 18.67,
   "hide": 19.96
  },
  {
   "text": "straight out of its HEAD.",
   "emph": [
    "head"
   ],
   "start": 20.0,
   "end": 21.08,
   "show": 19.96,
   "hide": 21.32
  },
  {
   "text": "And when it finally opens\u2026",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 21.36,
   "end": 22.58,
   "show": 21.32,
   "hide": 22.78
  },
  {
   "text": "it releases spores",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 22.82,
   "end": 23.87,
   "show": 22.78,
   "hide": 23.84
  },
  {
   "text": "onto the ants BELOW.",
   "emph": [
    "below"
   ],
   "start": 23.88,
   "end": 25.05,
   "show": 23.84,
   "hide": 25.29
  },
  {
   "text": "And beneath that one leaf\u2026",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 25.33,
   "end": 26.65,
   "show": 25.29,
   "hide": 26.91
  },
  {
   "text": "there could be dozens more ants",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 26.95,
   "end": 28.4,
   "show": 26.91,
   "hide": 28.365
  },
  {
   "text": "that died the exact same way.",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 28.405,
   "end": 30.16,
   "show": 28.365,
   "hide": 30.567
  }
 ],
